e\'s an incorrect service reference causing the redirects. Let me make sure the parameters are correct. The tool\'s required parameter is last_n_minutes, an integer. So the call should be {"name": "get_dependency_graph", "arguments": {"last_n_minutes": 10}}. That\'s the right approach.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"last_n_minutes": 10}', 'name': 'get_dependency_graph'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-857c5cdb3915e553', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 354, 'prompt_tokens': 10984, 'total_tokens': 11338, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfed1-da07-79a3-8fb6-667efe2fadc7-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'get_dependency_graph', 'args': {'last_n_minutes': 10}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-857c5cdb3915e553', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 10984, 'output_tokens': 354, 'total_tokens': 11338}), ToolMessage(content='meta=None content=[TextContent(type=\'text\', text="{\'data\': [{\'parent\': \'frontend\', \'child\': \'cart\', \'callCount\': 30}, {\'parent\': \'checkout\', \'child\': \'product-catalog\', \'callCount\': 10}, {\'parent\': \'frontend-proxy\', \'child\': \'frontend\', \'callCount\': 59}, {\'parent\': \'payment\', \'child\': \'flagd\', \'callCount\': 1}, {\'parent\': \'frontend\', \'child\': \'recommendation\', \'callCount\': 1}, {\'parent\': \'frontend\', \'child\': \'ad\', \'callCount\': 8}, {\'parent\': \'checkout\', \'child\': \'payment\', \'callCount\': 4}, {\'parent\': \'frontend\', \'child\': \'product-catalog\', \'callCount\': 36}, {\'parent\': \'checkout\', \'child\': \'shipping\', \'callCount\': 10}, {\'parent\': \'load-generator\', \'child\': \'frontend-proxy\', \'callCount\': 106}, {\'parent\': \'recommenda