hy they're returning 308 redirects, maybe a misconfiguration in the service's routing rules.\n</think>\n\nexec_read_only_kubectl_cmd  \nThe `ad` service exists as a ClusterIP but its reachability and pod health need verification. I will check the service's endpoints and pod status using `kubectl get endpoints ad -n astronomy-shop` and `kubectl get pods -l app=ad -n astronomy-shop` to ensure the service is properly routing traffic to healthy pods. This will confirm if the 308 redirects stem from service misconfiguration or pod unavailability.", additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=493, prompt_tokens=11584, total_tokens=12077, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfed2-78b1-7f73-8164-248b56b132ae-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 11584, 'output_tokens': 493, 'total_tokens': 12077}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='fe3468f3-0b7a-44ac-aff5-87aa55037ec1')]]
