ext trace_id=ef744abf15ef5c889df3ab004c88e391 span_id=b80d41e2a2085f6d trace_flags=01 \n2026-03-18 02:40:33 - oteldemo.AdService - Targeted ad request received for [accessories] trace_id=ef744abf15ef5c889df3ab004c88e391 span_id=b80d41e2a2085f6d trace_flags=01 \n2026-03-18 02:40:34 - oteldemo.AdService - no baggage found in context trace_id=a6debb9497fc51fdfa602d618147d08c span_id=ee506b73a4934bee trace_flags=01 \n2026-03-18 02:40:34 - oteldemo.AdService - Targeted ad request received for [accessories] trace_id=a6debb9497fc51fdfa602d618147d08c span_id=ee506b73a4934bee trace_flags=01 \n2026-03-18 02:40:41 - oteldemo.AdService - no baggage found in context trace_id=f8abe7024f0b0747f54586f5c70675d3 span_id=ecf0c4bf9766a372 trace_flags=01 \n2026-03-18 02:40:41 - oteldemo.AdService - Non-targeted ad request received, preparing random response. trace_id=f8abe7024f0b0747f54586f5c70675d3 span_id=ecf0c4bf9766a372 trace_flags... [truncated]', id='0a907eaa-f87e-4c41-a46d-fb60efdd27f8', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-a2a8c53a4c7d0808'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='2742b6f9-764a-4e45-a9b7-f3f462e18322')]]
